         parameter sets (tables 1/2/11/3, minsize/maxsize/flanking/reverse/methionine); see the file header. -->
    <EmbeddedResource Include="TestData\Getorf\getorf_find_modes.tsv" />
    <!-- TRANS-SIXFRAME-001 (A1-13, A1-20): EMBOSS 6.6.0 getorf binary output for -find 0..6, linear and -circular Y,
